OL,3,AGreen Party's Rachel Millward faces
OL,4,Aquestions from BBC local radio stations
OL,5,
OL,6,FRachel Millward, one of two Green Party
OL,7,Fdeputy leaders, is taking part in a
OL,8,Fseries of quick-fire interviews on BBC
OL,9,Flocal radio stations
OL,11,FHer party is preparing to host its
OL,12,Fautumn conference, which takes place in
OL,13,FBrighton from Friday
OL,15,FThe BBC local radio round has been a
OL,16,Fpre-conference tradition for many
OL,17,Fyears. The Conservatives, Greens,
OL,18,FLabour and Reform are all getting a
OL,19,Fsimilar opportunity before their
OL,20,Fconferences
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
